s://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20210826-1/1e4d4d9b66719baa8cb9bcebbf1b79c7.jpg", "year": "2017", "area": "西班牙", "actor": "乌苏拉·科尔维罗,伊西娅尔·伊图诺,阿尔瓦罗·莫奇", "director": "álex Pina", "content": "<p>八名窃贼将自己与人质反锁在西班牙皇家造币厂内，他们背后的犯罪首脑则妄图操纵警察实现自己的计划。</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "第01集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/dmbusxPU7J2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第02集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/SScHzeNfMs2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第03集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/7VS0q5GTFF2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第04集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/Ezb7T6zrUp2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第05集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/RMhJaHcJKF2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第06集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/TJ5AgvbpQ52/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第07集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/DQZWc2CZrT2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第08集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/h7Ab5sk28G2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第09集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/kTXjHuLt4u2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第10集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/AawQvN0Ycb2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第11集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/UaqNL3NJPp2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第12集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/Cr9RAHjDia2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第13集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/8pMtqEvEEf2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_979fb0478f_part3.json"}, {"id": 18682, "title": "英文系主任", "category": "Netflix自制剧", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20210821-1/1d3aded2624b907a3b50f03ac80223e5.jpg", "year": "2021", "area": "美国", "actor": "吴珊卓,杰伊·杜普拉斯,霍兰德·泰勒,鲍勃·巴拉班,娜娜·门萨,大卫·摩斯,Everly Carganilla,马西娅·德波尼斯,约瑟夫·坎农,马洛里·露,鲍勃·斯蒂芬森,Jordan Tyson,Ella Rubin,Ji-yong Lee,Darius Fraser,Ron Crawford", "director": "", "content": "<p>《叫她系主任》讲述金智允博士（吴珊卓 Sandra Oh 饰）在声名显赫的彭布罗克大学当上英文系系主任，她正努力适应这个新岗位。她是学校首位女系主任，更是大学职员之中少数的有色人种，必然要应付一般人不会面对的种种挑战。《叫她系主任》由吴珊卓、Jay Duplass、Holland Taylor、卜巴拉宾 (Bob Balaban)、Nana Mensah、大卫摩斯 (David Morse) 和 Everly Carganilla 主演，8 月 20 日在 Netflix 首播。</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "第01集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/3KErH9pQMn2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第02集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/35EzL5BRVM2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第03集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/1cJJwFqehV2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第04集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/YSAJi7fzvt2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第05集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/WEwzVNVJu42/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第06集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/RjCEYK7Gwt2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_979fb0478f_part3.json"}, {"id": 18561, "title": "如何在网上卖迷幻药第二季", "category": "Netflix自制剧", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20210821-1/a12ccac695ec297e0f81ed6f7491f1ec.jpg", "year": "2020", "area": "德国", "actor": "马克西米利安·蒙特,丹尼尔·卡伯,莱娜·克棱克,达米安·哈顿,莱昂尼·韦斯洛,朱丽娜·阿米利·特林克斯,卢娜·巴蒂斯特·夏勒,罗兰·里贝林,伊莎贝尔·俦斯尼克,鲁本·布林克曼,弗洛伦廷·威尔,莱娜·乌泽多夫斯基", "director": "", "content": "<p>在第二季中，三位好友莫里茨、莱尼和丹想搞明白如何更快在网上卖迷幻药。他们的业务呈指数级增长，仅三个人难以满足市场的需求。他们的私人生活也出现转变。丽莎开始怀疑莫里茨的古怪行为，丹决心向他的父亲证明自己可以自食其力，莱尼则偶然与名为“xKira7”的神秘程序员展开了一场网恋。\r\n　　莫里茨单枪匹马在荷兰做生意并深陷谎言，他还面临着首次恋爱危机和高中毕业，并试图找到工作与生活的平衡，他的荷兰合作伙伴实际上是腐败的黑帮。事实证明，不仅警察对布巴的死感兴趣，他异常古怪的家人也开始询问各种问题。</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "第01集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/sdcZ1cTZQR2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第02集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/N6P0tfUZsf2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第03集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/jG5RwT1xCp2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第04集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/152jVz6rp12/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第05集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/sGn7eUW8SC2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第06集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/3Gff0qEAVe2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_979fb0478f_part3.json"}, {"id": 18560, "title": "如何在网上卖迷幻药第一季", "category": "Netflix自制剧", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20210821-1/f044006762c27b0b9395edc81ec2acb8.jpg", "year": "2019", "area": "德国", "actor": "马克西米利安·蒙特,丹尼尔·卡伯,莱娜·克棱克,达米安·哈顿,莱昂尼·韦斯洛,卢娜·巴蒂斯特·夏勒,比亚内·梅德尔,罗兰·里贝林,朱丽娜·阿米利·特林克斯,乌尔里克·福克特斯,伊莎贝尔·俦斯尼克,斯蒂芬·雷斯佩格,鲁本·布林克曼", "director": "阿尔内·菲尔杜森,拉尔斯·蒙塔格", "content": "<p>如何把女友校园毒贩那里赢回来？对于莫瑞兹来说，答案显而易见：卖更棒的迷幻药。在卧室里，莫瑞兹与好友伦尼一起在网上开始贩毒，并出人意料地大获成功。不久后，意外成为毒贩的他们遇到了毒品行当最常见的问题：满足市场需求、品质控制，最重要的是不被抓到。《如何在网上卖迷幻药》是一个现代故事，讲述了失恋、友情的起起落落以及成长过程中所面临的阻碍。</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "第01集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/dKnfnxfmBP2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第02集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/tiXzs1QnrU2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第03集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/pKsGrA9R6c2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第04集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/Er6Lq2nCME2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第05集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/DjjMFt99c82/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第06集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/BQscq71HKf2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_979fb0478f_part3.json"}, {"id": 17026, "title": "艾米丽在巴黎第一季", "category": "Netflix自制剧", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20210811-1/1c582b0c6b6472b4d2da0b9244b6f7c0.jpg", "year": "2020", "area": "美国", "actor": "莉莉·柯林斯,阿什利·朴,菲利平·勒鲁瓦-博利约,卡米尔·拉萨特,凯特·沃什,让-克里斯托夫·布维,克里斯多夫·泰克,克洛德·佩隆,亚历克西斯·巴尔博萨,米歇尔·贝尔,克里斯托夫·吉贝,亚历珊德拉·耶尔马克,卢卡斯·布哈沃,Elizabeth Tan,William Abadie,Isaiah Hodges,Yohan Levy,Charles Martins,Romain Barreau,Samuel Arnold", "director": "安德鲁·弗莱明,Zoe Cassavetes,彼得·劳尔", "content": "<p>二十多岁的艾米丽来自芝加哥，是一位雄心勃勃的营销主管，在她所在的公司收购了一家法国奢侈品营销公司后，她出乎意料地在巴黎寻得了自己梦寐以求的工作，负责改进公司的社交媒体策略。艾米莉在巴黎的新生活充满了令人兴奋的冒险和惊喜的挑战，她要努力与同事打成一片、结交新朋友，并开始新的恋情。</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "第01集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/MDVurWyYLp2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第02集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/txpWpdgYk52/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第03集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/4LDrmCfcH42/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第04集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/K7epPG4msu2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第05集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/fjdmkjZdvC2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第06集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/sxJnFYAnQH2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第07集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/gwSAu3V0p72/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_979fb0478f_part3.json"}, {"id": 16602, "title": "好想做一次第二季", "category": "Netflix自制剧", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20210808-1/95460e545d061438a41b6d20973ad37a.jpg", "year": "2021", "area": "美国", "actor": "麦特里伊·拉玛克里斯南,芮查·莫佳妮,嘉伦·李维森,达伦·巴内特,李·罗德里格斯,雷蒙娜·杨,约翰·麦肯罗,普娜·贾甘纳坦,森德希·拉玛莫西,亚当·沙皮罗,本杰明·诺里斯,迪诺·佩特拉,鲁西·科塔,克里斯蒂娜·卡尔切纳,P·J·伯恩,安德鲁·T·李,科曼,梅根·苏丽,马丁·马丁内兹,泰勒·阿尔瓦雷兹,吉吉·哈迪德,安迪·萨姆伯格,莉莉·D·摩尔", "director": "卡比尔·阿克塔,莉娜·汗,玛姬·盖瑞,特斯塔姆·莎佩罗,阿奴·瓦利亚,克莱尔·斯坎伦,朗·费希尔", "content": "<p>一个宅女，两个男朋友，江湖从此多事。《好想做一次》隆重回归，推出第 2 季，7 月 15 日在 Netflix 上线。</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "第01集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/wjAqGx3rrS2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第02集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/21/mecRbksEPH2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第03集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/9eeBMMRAC22/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第04集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/dh7UVQ2P4Z2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第05集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/A0LDcyuu3h2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第06集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/21/JJ6JnAu16S2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第07集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/21/CdrWz1QR1v2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第08集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/F0a9KiPgQR2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第09集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/21/GUeiwqiPSU2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第10集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/21/9pw2uTQcU52/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_979fb0478f_part3.json"}, {"id": 2391, "title": "柯明斯基理论第三季", "category": "Netflix自制剧", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20210706-1/3cae08479768fc7326d4ec2eaddf7806.jpg", "year": "2021", "area": "美国", "actor": "迈克尔·道格拉斯,丽莎·艾德尔斯汀,简·西摩,凯瑟琳·特纳", "director": "查克·罗瑞", "content": "", "episodes": [{"name": "第01集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/24/pSVrizE8PJ2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第02集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/if5dStmDX42/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第03集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/TxpiPgGkJw2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第04集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/ZNkjQm71aj2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第05集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/24/AdF3FMELhj2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第06集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/24/emJ3DYPngm2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_979fb0478f_part3.json"}, {"id": 548, "title": "爱，死亡和机器人第二季", "category": "Netflix自制剧", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20210628-1/51fc97536ded22002cccbaca344e17e0.jpg", "year": "2021", "area": "美国", "actor": "诺兰·诺斯,艾米丽·奥布莱恩,艾洛蒂·袁", "director": "蒂姆·米勒,肉食部门,罗伯特·瓦利", "content": "<p>Netflix动画剧集《爱，死亡和机器人》续订第二季！[功夫熊猫2]导演吕寅荣将加盟担任制片人。该剧首季由大卫·芬奇、蒂姆·米勒担任制作。第二季开播时间等详细信息暂未确定。</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "第01集", "url": "https://v6.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv6/202309/07/WMhrYBqHUq1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第02集", "url": "https://v6.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv6/202309/07/ZvdZuqQpLa1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第03集", "url": "https://v6.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv6/202309/07/1peFhwN9Dh1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第04集", "url": "https://v6.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv6/202309/07/Jgzz1KLWEs1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第05集", "url": "https://v6.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv6/202309/07/Liq3UfgZtP1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第06集", "url": "https://v6.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv6/202309/07/NifZvzVnQW1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第07集", "url": "https://v6.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv6/202309/07/EwmAEy9jiv1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第08集", "url": "https://v6.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv6/202309/07/hnp3KMBzMR1/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_979fb0478f_part3.json"}, {"id": 547, "title": "爱，死亡和机器人第一季", "category": "Netflix自制剧", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20210628-1/9b7168ecfc603eb569db927d67547fcc.jpg", "year": "2019", "area": "美国", "actor": "斯科特·怀特,诺兰·诺斯,马修·杨·金", "director": "维克多·马尔多纳多,加布里埃尔·彭纳基奥利,阿尔弗雷多·托雷斯", "content": "<p>这部名为《爱，死亡和机器人》的动画短片合集由18部分组成，每部分时长5-15分钟。这些短片涵盖多种类型，包括科幻、奇幻、恐怖和喜剧；这些短片也将包含多种形式，包括传统2D和3DCGI短片。18部短片导演列表：1.桑尼的优势 Dave Wilson2.三个机器人 Víctor Maldonado&amp;Alfredo Torres3.证人 Alberto Mielgo4.机动装甲 Franck Balson5.噬魂者 Owen Sullivan6.当酸奶统治世界 Victor Maldonado &amp; Alfredo Torres7.裂缝以外 Leon Berlue,Dominique Boidin,Remi Kozyra,Maxime Luere8.祝有好的收获 Oliver Thomas9.垃圾场 Javier Recio Gracia10.变形者 Gabriele Pennacchioli11.帮手 Jon Yeo12.古鱼复苏 Damian Nenow13.新运十三 Jerome Chen14.齐马的作品 Robert Valley15.盲点 Vitality Shushko16.冰河时代 Tim Miller17.不一样的历史 Victor Maldonado &amp; Alfredo Torres18.秘密战争 Istvan Zorkoczy</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "第01集", "url": "https://v6.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv6/202309/07/Ru1qZuEtsN1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第02集", "url": "https://v6.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv6/202309/07/B13CdNGcFu1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第03集", "url": "https://v6.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv6/202309/07/s3YMtVUX7P1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第04集", "url": "https://v6.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv6/202309/07/BQ97FRuxug1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第05集", "url": "https://v6.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv6/202309/07/t0GV8nA3WH1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第06集", "url": "https://v6.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv6/202309/07/xxgLSKZmDg1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第07集", "url": "https://v6.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv6/202309/07/DP68GMzwRW1/video/